# SurveyAll
#
# Nothing secret belongs in this repository, which is why it is safe to
# make public. Your instructor password and signing key live in
# Cloudflare's encrypted secret store (INSTRUCTOR_PASSWORD, AUTH_SECRET),
# set from the dashboard — never in a file here.
#
# app/config.js is deliberately NOT ignored: it holds no keys, only the
# optional API base URL.

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log

node_modules/
.wrangler/
.dev.vars
.vscode/
.idea/

# local scratch
scratch/
*.local.*

# local editor/agent settings
.claude/

# Video masters. The site serves the compressed encode (media/home-loop.mp4);
# the full-resolution exports these come from live in media/source/ and are
# kept out of git — a 40 MB file committed once stays in history forever.
# .assetsignore already keeps this folder off the published site.
media/source/
